MAIN
MOVE TEMP 17 4
MOVE TEMP 18 HALLOCATE TEMP 17
MOVE TEMP 0 TEMP 18
MOVE TEMP 19 8
MOVE TEMP 20 HALLOCATE TEMP 19
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 20
MOVE TEMP 21 TEMP 1
HSTORE TEMP 0 0 TEMP 21
MOVE TEMP 22 A_ved_foo
HSTORE TEMP 1 0 TEMP 22
MOVE TEMP 23 A_ved_bar
HSTORE TEMP 1 4 TEMP 23
MOVE TEMP 24 2
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 24
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 4 TEMP 3 0
MOVE TEMP 25 CALL TEMP 4 ( TEMP 0 TEMP 2 )
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 25
PRINT TEMP 5
END
A_ved_foo [ 2 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 26 8
MOVE TEMP 27 HALLOCATE TEMP 26
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 27
MOVE TEMP 28 8
MOVE TEMP 29 HALLOCATE TEMP 28
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 29
MOVE TEMP 30 TEMP 6
HSTORE TEMP 5 0 TEMP 30
MOVE TEMP 31 B_ved_setf2
HSTORE TEMP 6 0 TEMP 31
MOVE TEMP 32 B_ved_getLambda
HSTORE TEMP 6 4 TEMP 32
MOVE TEMP 33 0
MOVE TEMP 34 TEMP 33
HSTORE TEMP 5 4 TEMP 34
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 5
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 4 0
HLOAD TEMP 8 TEMP 7 0
MOVE TEMP 35 CALL TEMP 8 ( TEMP 4 )
MOVE TEMP 9 TEMP 35
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 9
HLOAD TEMP 10 TEMP 4 0
HLOAD TEMP 11 TEMP 10 4
MOVE TEMP 36 CALL TEMP 11 ( TEMP 4 )
MOVE TEMP 12 TEMP 36
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 12
MOVE TEMP 37 1
MOVE TEMP 13 TEMP 37
HLOAD TEMP 14 TEMP 3 0
HLOAD TEMP 15 TEMP 14 0
MOVE TEMP 38 CALL TEMP 15 ( TEMP 3 TEMP 13 )
MOVE TEMP 16 TEMP 38
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 16

RETURN TEMP 2
END
A_ved_bar [ 2 ]
BEGIN
CJUMP TEMP 1 L1
MOVE TEMP 39 1
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 39
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 3
JUMP L2
L1  NOOP
MOVE TEMP 40 10
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 40
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 4
L2  NOOP

RETURN TEMP 2
END
B_ved_setf2 [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 41 50
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 41
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 0
MOVE TEMP 42 TEMP 1
HSTORE TEMP 2 4 TEMP 42
MOVE TEMP 43 0
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 43

RETURN TEMP 3
END
B_ved_getLambda [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 44 3
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 44
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 45 4
MOVE TEMP 46 3
MOVE TEMP 47 TIMES TEMP 45 TEMP 46
MOVE TEMP 48 HALLOCATE TEMP 47
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 48
MOVE TEMP 49 4
MOVE TEMP 50 HALLOCATE TEMP 49
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 50
MOVE TEMP 51 TEMP 4
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 TEMP 51
MOVE TEMP 52 Lambda_ved_1
HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 52
MOVE TEMP 53 TEMP 0
HSTORE TEMP 3 4 TEMP 53
MOVE TEMP 54 TEMP 1
HSTORE TEMP 3 8 TEMP 54

RETURN TEMP 3
END
Lambda_ved_1 [ 2 ]
BEGIN
HLOAD TEMP 2 TEMP 0 8
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 0 TEMP 3
MOVE TEMP 55 4
MOVE TEMP 56 HALLOCATE TEMP 55
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 56
MOVE TEMP 57 8
MOVE TEMP 58 HALLOCATE TEMP 57
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 58
MOVE TEMP 59 TEMP 5
HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 59
MOVE TEMP 60 A_ved_foo
HSTORE TEMP 5 0 TEMP 60
MOVE TEMP 61 A_ved_bar
HSTORE TEMP 5 4 TEMP 61
HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 4 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 4
MOVE TEMP 62 CALL TEMP 7 ( TEMP 4 TEMP 1 )
MOVE TEMP 8 TEMP 62
HLOAD TEMP 9 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 63 PLUS TEMP 8 TEMP 9
MOVE TEMP 10 TEMP 63
MOVE TEMP 64 PLUS TEMP 2 TEMP 10
MOVE TEMP 11 TEMP 64

RETURN TEMP 11
END

